OL,3,GNEWSAPC's best friend to don his Great
OL,4,ANorth Run vest
OL,5,
OL,6,FPC Matthew Blades' best friend is
OL,7,Ftaking his place in the Great North Run
OL,8,Fand raising funds for Parkinson's UK on
OL,9,Fhis behalf.
OL,11,FHe was one of two Cleveland Police
OL,12,Fofficers who died when their patrol
OL,13,Fvehicle was hit by a car going the
OL,14,Fwrong way on the A66 near Middlesbrough
OL,15,Flast month, killing seven people.
OL,17,FPC Blades' friend of 30 years Daragh
OL,18,FBurke, from Guisborough, will step into
OL,19,Fhis place for Sunday's half marathon
OL,20,Fand said: "I just wanted to make sure
OL,21,Fthat his vest makes it over the finish
OL,22,Fline."
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
