OL,3,GNEWSAPC's best friend to don his Great
OL,4,ANorth Run vest
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 37-year-old said his friend would
OL,7,Fbe "laughing his head off that I'm
OL,8,Fdoing it" as his starting place was
OL,9,Fjust behind the elite runners - despite
OL,10,Fhim having two weeks of training.
